en-vs-the-vultures-a-social-tragedy-mobilising-spaniards" /><summary type="html">Protests are ongoing in Madrid right now, with many demonstrators holding signs and banners that read “Maricarmen vs the Vultures”. “Maricarmen, you are not alone.” Or “Ni una Maricarmen más.” Not one more Maricarmen.</summary><category term="Spotlight" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo XIV addresses youth at giant Paris Mass</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f6a962358a8bf81d11581f93116d98f485dd680629d4e649b0245ec493c3f49b</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T17:04:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260926-pope-leo-xiv-addresses-youth-at-giant-paris-mass" /><summary type="html">🇫🇷 🇻🇦 During #Pope Leo XIV's giant Mass at the Place de la Concorde in #Paris on Saturday, he spoke directly to Catholic youth, calling them the "Church of today".
 
The pontiff made efforts to connect with young people during his visit, holding a youth vigil at the Stade de #France on Friday.</summary></entry><entry><title>Thousands march in Madrid to protest eviction of 87-year-old woman</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa42f6f5aabeaea3aad1fdfcc3113c6170c4d51231b62c6d156a7a1b5fbb21d6</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T17:04:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260926-thousands-march-in-madrid-to-protest-eviction-of-87-year-old-woman" /><summary type="html">The eviction of 87-year-old Maricarmen Abascal on Wednesday sparked a thousands-strong protest in the streets of Madrid Saturday, with demonstrators calling for greater protection for tenants. Widespread anger at rising housing costs have put pressure on centre-left Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez, whose government is expected to approve a package of pro-tenant measures in its next cabinet meeting.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo XIV 600,000 people gather for Mass on the Champs-Élysées</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:42beb8229fe3f30a3b6358daaa3841388b72e1a0025290681b2f887832cda8a7</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T16:46:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260926-pope-leo-xiv-600-000-people-gather-for-mass-on-the-champs-%C3%A9lys%C3%A9es" /><summary type="html">🇻🇦👀How do you get into one of the largest outdoor Mass in the world?
 
Pope Leo XIV celebrated an open-air Mass in front of hundreds of thousands of faithful on Saturday, September 26, in Paris.
 
France 24’s Stella Elgersma was there to tell you more! #Pope #France #LeoXIV</summary></entry><entry><title>'A once-in-a-lifetime event': Faithful and curious flock to Pope Leo XIV's Mass in Paris</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:32280ac91bf10b93c6a687e39fbb6fd16c27e38b75fbdc10589ab5bb2d9e15ee</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T16:24:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france/20260926-a-once-in-a-lifetime-event-faithful-and-curious-flock-to-pope-leo-xiv-s-mass-in-paris--b436a397cb11.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20260926-a-once-in-a-lifetime-event-faithful-and-curious-flock-to-pope-leo-xiv-s-mass-in-paris" /><summary type="html">Some 700,000 people are estimated to have packed the Champs-Élysées and Place de la Concorde in Paris on Saturday for Pope Leo XIV's open-air Mass, the high point of his first official visit to France. Scouts, nuns, families and curious onlookers told FRANCE 24 why they came, from quiet prayer to hopes of spotting Canadian singer Céline Dion.</summary><category term="France" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo XIV calls to protect migrants during his official visit to France</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d631080abec7fa40352840cb448f615fdf5c7e2c06a836f7d2ed9fc67e6f7cec</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T16:16:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/pope-leo-xiv-calls-to-protect-migrants-during-his-official-visit-to-france--9c48e03c2ca2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/pope-leo-xiv-calls-to-protect-migrants-during-his-official-visit-to-france" /><summary type="html">Father Philip Larrey and Father Michael Baggott are on France 24.</summary></entry><entry><title>At least 16 people killed as Russia and Ukraine trade deadly air strikes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:15c734acc177458cb5e7bb1499898102e1329e43ab46e0ce3c40d7ee655e652