/entry><entry><title>Leo XIV fills central Paris with around 600,000 people at giant outdoor Mass</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:206ff6324fe04d77cd7ff2abfd6cbd3d6647926aa20dbcdad4a499d8a14cd63f</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T15:09:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/leo-xiv-fills-central-paris-with-around-600-000-people-at-giant-outdoor-mass--ed3b198cc44b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/leo-xiv-fills-central-paris-with-around-600-000-people-at-giant-outdoor-mass" /><summary type="html">Hundreds of thousands of people packed Paris’ iconic Champs-Élysées avenue for Pope Leo XIV’s big outdoor Mass on Saturday, a sign of the Catholic Church’s enduring appeal in the once staunchly Catholic but officially secular country.</summary></entry><entry><title>Leo XIV visits France: Pope blesses babies on way to giant Paris Mass</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3880fcb3ae5d0c9305d3ae2563715d150674c683e488b219b46c549105020c98</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T15:03:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/leo-xiv-visits-france-pope-blesses-babies-on-way-to-giant-paris-mass--160ac0145c31.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/leo-xiv-visits-france-pope-blesses-babies-on-way-to-giant-paris-mass" /><summary type="html">🇫🇷 🇻🇦 While #PopeLeo XIV rode down #Paris's iconic Champs-Élysées avenue to hold Mass, he took the opportunity to bless babies from the "popemobile</summary></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo XIV visits Lourdes after giant Paris mass to meet clergy abuse victims</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:120fdc1f3d100983372c986129d8191bacf6045e4448826c6a8eac80953b10be</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T13:40:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20260926-pope-visits-lourdes-after-giant-paris-mass-to-meet-clergy-abuse-victims" /><summary type="html">After two days in Paris where he drew hundreds of thousands of worshippers, Pope Leo XIV will continue his visit to France on Sunday in the southwestern pilgrimage town of Lourdes with a private meeting with victims of sexual abuse within the Catholic Church. Leo's four-day trip is the first official papal visit to France in nearly two decades.</summary><category term="France" /></entry><entry><title>🔴 Live: Pope Leo celebrates Mass before hundreds of thousands at Concord in central Paris</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a9fab9f54d717da7069083387b55b1a45d6f68fa6e472a413aead9305078e947</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T12:56:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260926-live-more-than-half-a-million-expected-at-pope-s-open-air-mass-in-paris--4ded6b6b0a9b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260926-live-more-than-half-a-million-expected-at-pope-s-open-air-mass-in-paris" /></entry><entry><title>Hundreds of thousands turn out for Pope's popemobile parade along Champs-Élysées</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f63d7a790073abfa8344e09913b458410e2ab7afa8006c5ba8e655358ab47a02</id><updated>2026-09-27T05:27:52Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T12:54:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260926-hundreds-of-thousands-turn-out-for-pope-s-popemobile-parade-along-champs-_lys_es--45bd0ee665db.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260926-hundreds-of-thousands-turn-out-for-pope-s-popemobile-parade-along-champs-%C3%A9lys%C3%A9es" /><summary type="html">Stan Chu Ilo, Senior Research Professor at DePaul University, is our guest.</summary></entry><entry><title>Huge crowds cheer Pope Leo along Champs-Elysees ahead of Paris mass</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:594aac3786c93d138e9b4434cc3a63c4b65e6d20b3d6835a6bd8cea52d4d9f1b</id><updated>2026-09-27T05